BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Salsa/Bachata/Kizomba GTA
UID:event_315578693@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260725T033830Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260726T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260726T220000
SUMMARY:Baila in the West Sunday Social
DESCRIPTION:Salsa | Bachata | Kizomba GTA\nBest way to get a hold of us is
  on our [WhatsApp chat](https://chat.whatsapp.com/Kj63TzHIqYL5hPrRJolhyD)\
 , also great way to join a community of amazing like-minded people :)\n\n*
 **Let's Dance!***\n***¡Vamos a bailar!***\n\n***DJ Geronimo 🎧 will be 
 playing your favorite Salsa 🎵 Bachata 🎶 Chacha 🎵 Merengue hits 
 🔊 DJ Sweetlike will be jamming in the Kizomba room***\n\nCover $10 befo
 re 7pm - $15 after 7pm - includes:\n***Free Bachata Lesson at 6:15pm with 
 entrance to event***\n***Dancing til 10pm***\n\n***\\*Casual dress code***
 \n***\\*Bring your own refreshments***\n\n***👠Please wear comfortable &
  clean shoes👞***\n\n**Location:**\n📍 40 Stavebank Rd N — Port Cred
 it Memorial Arena
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/salsa-bachata-kizomba-gta/events/3155
 78693/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260706T224022Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260706T224022Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
